graph LR
    SDK[CodeFlare SDK<br/>Python Client Library]

    %% External Python Dependencies
    SDK -->|job submission client| Ray["ray 2.55.1"]
    SDK -->|K8s API client| K8sClient["kubernetes >= 27.2.0"]
    SDK -->|authentication| KubeAuthKit["kube-authkit >= 0.4.0"]
    SDK -->|TLS cert generation<br/>RSA-3072, SHA-256| Cryptography["cryptography >= 46.0.7"]
    SDK -->|OpenShift API| OCPClient["openshift-client 1.0.18"]
    SDK -->|data validation| Pydantic["pydantic >= 2.10.6"]
    SDK -->|terminal output| Rich["rich >= 12.5, < 15.0"]
    SDK -->|Jupyter UI| IPyWidgets["ipywidgets 8.1.2"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies (CRD interactions)
    SDK -->|"RayCluster/RayJob CRDs<br/>(ray.io/v1)"| KubeRay[KubeRay Operator]
    SDK -->|"LocalQueue/WorkloadPriorityClass<br/>(kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1)"| Kueue[Kueue Controller]
    SDK -->|"HTTPRoute/Gateway<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1)"| GatewayAPI[RHOAI Gateway<br/>Gateway API]
    SDK -->|"Route<br/>(route.openshift.io/v1)"| OCPRoutes[OpenShift Routes]
    SDK -->|"GatewayConfig CR<br/>(services.platform.opendatahub.io)"| GatewayConfig[GatewayConfig CR]
    SDK -.->|CA bundle mount| TrustedCA[ODH Trusted CA Bundle<br/>ConfigMap]

    %% Runtime environment
    Workbench[RHOAI/ODH Workbench] -->|runs| SDK

    %% Distribution
    SDK -.->|version synced to| Notebooks[opendatahub-io/notebooks<br/>Workbench Images]

    %% Integration Points (components that use the SDK's output)
    KubeRay -->|reconciles CRs<br/>creates| RayCluster[Ray Cluster<br/>Head + Workers]
    Kueue -->|admission control<br/>quota enforcement| RayCluster

    %% External services accessed at runtime
    SDK -->|"CRD CRUD, Secrets<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS"| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API Server]
    SDK -->|"job submission<br/>10001/TCP mTLS"| RayHead[Ray Head Node]
    SDK -->|"dashboard check<br/>8265/TCP HTTPS"| RayDashboard[Ray Dashboard]

